{"kind":"Article","sha256":"32ba248e3bc359ce3f0b11162d95fb1f8b8115971eeeccb0f1155b69900793dc","slug":"monstrous","location":"/origins/physicality/monstrous.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Monstrous","github":"https://github.com/SkillWeaverNexus/skillweavernexus.github.io","keywords":[],"thumbnail":"/build/monstrous-copy-2492f3da7052cd1a6a95148c98b1e8c3.png","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"monstrous.md","url":"/build/monstrous-31f4c767d731c538a7842123267c1a1f.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/build/monstrous-copy-2492f3da7052cd1a6a95148c98b1e8c3.png","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"oFOn8nwesa","urlSource":"../../img/origins/monstrous-copy.png"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have a lineage leading to (or some sort of event-triggered) monstrous capabilities. Choose one of the following (or work with your GM to make a new one):","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"g5PPVx8VmN"}],"key":"imLR7LmLCn"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vampiric","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"Q6NTxZuuq9"}],"key":"oCKEGNNODJ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have some level of vampirism. You gain a bite (melee) attack which costs 2 stamina, uses your personality die [13], and deals damage equal to your player level and inflicts the bleeding condition using a d4. You gain the spell Suggest for free, so long as you have the Magic Initiate ability. Your GM may impose sunlight related debuffs.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"FVlkmdn2Xs"}],"key":"fE9aGdvlz6"}],"key":"PI6HFZF6LW"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Were-creature","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"HnB5Zvb18Z"}],"key":"qajLBEFzH9"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have some level of lycanthropy. You gain a claw (melee) attack which which costs 2 stamina, uses your Physicality die [13] and deals damage equal to your player level, inflicting the bleeding condition using a d4. Under a full moon or GM-defined natural condition, your damage is doubled and bleed dice moves up 1.","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"wMIavRa2QA"}],"key":"Izp69aShYp"}],"key":"AdraUu21mP"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Zombie","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"TcMMTKEWdc"}],"key":"gP3Nud3UCd"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You are at least partially undead. You gain a claw attack which uses your Healing die [13], costs 2 stamina, and deals damage equal to your player level and inflicts the poisoned condition using a d4. You can survive for up to 10 minutes without air to breathe.","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"srZJDuHqXx"}],"key":"TEtndbbIrx"}],"key":"uPswcoAHun"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Faerie","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"A0fm6yk1IY"}],"key":"exdcjkiWho"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You are touched by Fae magic or hail from a fae lineage. You gain a psychic sliver (range 30 ft) attack which costs 2 stamina, uses your Reasoning die [13], and deals damage equal to your player level, inflicting the charmed condition using a d4. You have access to the Minor Invisibility spell, so long as you have the Magic Initiate ability.","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"NHvfuQQ8gs"}],"key":"YkKOA7KoyT"}],"key":"dnJS3idUaQ"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dragonite","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"key":"XSSPRF2BBt"}],"key":"k0xmLGk09l"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have lineage touched by dragons or a similar creature. You gain a fire breath (range, 15 ft) ability which costs 2 stamina, deals damage equal to your player level and inflicts the burning condition using a d4. You gain access to the Minor Shapeshift spell for free, so long as you have the Magic Initiate ability.","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"key":"gVDp65HoUe"}],"key":"D6FWUYp605"}],"key":"bhD7RZgNJX"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Increased Potency","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"O8BSk7EKsj"}],"identifier":"increased-potency","label":"Increased Potency","html_id":"increased-potency","implicit":true,"key":"Zdj58Gk5B7"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"If your player level reaches 5, your condition die increases from d4 to d6. At level 10, it increases from d6 to d8.","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"key":"r71K4o8YJX"}],"key":"WnfVLYhE05"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"tip","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","ch